ngshu-021-wangzhan:p004:m0137"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan-wyd","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangzhan-wyd1739","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan-wyd:p004","quote":"長玄","mention_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan-wyd:p004:m0111"},{"mention_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p003:m0072","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-021-wangzhan","quote":"長玄"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"梁書王瞻子，著作佐郎、早卒。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAACAA","source_assertion_id":"a-liang021-changxuan-zhan","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangzhan-ws1544250","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan:p004","quote":"高祖霸府開，以瞻爲大司馬相國諮議參軍，領錄事。梁臺建，爲侍中，遷左民尚書，俄轉吏部尚書。瞻性率亮，居選部，所舉多行其意。頗嗜酒，每飲或竟日，而精神益朗贍，不廢簿領。高祖每稱瞻有三術，射、朞、酒也。尋加左軍將軍，以疾不拜，仍爲侍中，領驍騎將軍，未拜，卒，時年四十九。諡康侯。子長玄，著作佐郎，早卒。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan:p004:m0137","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan:p004:m0086","source_term":"子長玄"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"王瞻傳末之子。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangzhan-ws1544250","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-021-wangzhan:p004:m0137"],"paragraph_ids":["c-liangshu-021-wangzhan:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangzhan:p004:m0137","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-021-wangzhan:p004:m0137"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-liangshu-021-